+// Only add the SourceHandler if the browser supports MediaSourceExtensions.
+// HOAST360 patch: iPhone Safari exposes ONLY ManagedMediaSource, and the
+// dash.js this build rides (4.7.4 via the webpack alias) prefers MMS and
+// drives it correctly; probe run wwzdd2 (iPhone 17) played 4K avc1 through
